  "title": "PILLAR and Quantization: Private Retrieval in RAG",
  "summary": "PILLAR introduces a privacy-preserving RAG system that uses private hybrid retrieval to balance privacy and retrieval quality, while Quantization enables private dense retrieval against malicious service providers.",
